ss="modal" aria-label="Close"> <i class="fa-solid fa-xmark"></i> </div> <h4 class="text-white">Synopsis: One Piece</h4> <p class="text-muted mt-2"> As a child, Monkey D. Luffy dreamed of becoming the King of the Pirates. But his life changed when he accidentally gained the power to stretch like rubber...at the cost of never being able to swim again! Now Luffy, with the help of a motley collection of nakama, is setting off in search of &quot;One Piece,&quot; said to be the greatest treasure in the world... </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container"> <div class="main-inner manga-bottom"> <aside class="content"> <section class="m-list"> <nav class="chapvol-tab" data-tabs> <a class="tab active" data-name="chapter" style="pointer-events: none; cursor: default;">Chapter</a> </nav> <div class="tab-content" data-name="chapter"> <div class="list-body"> <ul id="chapter-list" class="scroll-sm">   <li class="item" data-number="1310"> <a href="https://bato1.com/read/one-piece/chapter-1194" title="Chapter 1194"> <span>Chapter 1194: </span> <span>14 day ago</span> </a> </li>  <li class="item" data-number="1309"> <a href="https://bato1.com/read/one-piece/chapter-1193" title="Chapter 1193"> <span>Chapter 1193: </span> <span>30 day ago</span> </a> </li>  <li class="item" data-number="1308"> <a href="https://bato1.com/read/one-piece/chapter-1192" title="Chapter 1192"> <span>Chapter 1192: </span> <span>36 day ago</span> </a> </li>  <li class="item" data-number="1296"> <a href="https://bato1.com/read/one-piece/chapter-1191" title="Chapter 1191"> <span>Chapter 1191: </span> <span>51 day ago</span> </a> </li>  <li class="item" data-number="1295"> <a href="https://bato1.com/read/one-piece/chapter-1190" title="Chapter 1190"> <span>Chapter 1190: </span> <span>51 day ago</span> </a> </li>  <li class="item" data-number="1294"> <a href="https://bato1.com/read/one-piece/chapter-1189" title="Chapter 1189"> <span>Chapter 1189: </span> <span>72 day ago</span> </a> </li>  <li class="item" data